<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>POST 1: 과목 등록</title></head>
<body>
  <h1>POST 1: 과목 등록</h1>
  <form method="post" action="/subjects">
    <label>과목명 <input name="subject" maxlength="100" required></label>
    <label>점수 <input type="number" name="score" min="-2147483648" max="2147483647" required></label>
    <button type="submit">과목 등록</button>
  </form>
  <%- include("partials/sample_table", { subjects }) %>
  <p>폼 또는 주소를 통해 요청하고 조회 결과를 확인하세요.</p>
</body>
</html>
